{"id":"ad966749904b15ec","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-obeys-cost.md","title":"近似服从代价","display":"df-obeys-cost — 近似服从代价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-obeys-cost","aliases":["43-df-obeys-cost"],"display":"df-obeys-cost — 近似服从代价","depends_on":["[[43-df-cost-function]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-computable-approximation]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.15.1.28, printed p.425 / PDF p.445; §15.5.3","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-obeys-cost"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-obeys-cost</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-obeys-cost — 近似服从代价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a404d2c25074b0b1\" href=\"?note=a404d2c25074b0b1\" title=\"43-df-cost-function\">43-df-cost-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e87d656c032390a9\" href=\"?note=e87d656c032390a9\" title=\"43-df-computable-approximation\">43-df-computable-approximation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.15.1.28, printed p.425 / PDF p.445; §15.5.3"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CostFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{CostFunction}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a404d2c25074b0b1\" href=\"?note=a404d2c25074b0b1\" title=\"43-df-cost-function\">43-df-cost-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是下式量化的全函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e87d656c032390a9\" href=\"?note=e87d656c032390a9\" title=\"43-df-computable-approximation\">43-df-computable-approximation</a> 中可计算且逐输入最终稳定于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的正式定义。下式为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 构造仅在变化阶段定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_a\">\\(m_a\\)</span>；费用级数在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,+\\infty]\">\\([0,+\\infty]\\)</span> 中取非负级数和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(m_a):=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;a(x,s)\\ne a(x,s+1)\\},\\qquad m_a(s):=\\min\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:a(x,s)\\ne a(x,s+1)\\}\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(m_a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(m_a):=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;a(x,s)\\ne a(x,s+1)\\},\\qquad m_a(s):=\\min\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:a(x,s)\\ne a(x,s+1)\\}\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(m_a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ObeysCost}(A,c)\\iff\\mathrm{CostFunction}(c)\\land\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^2}\\,[\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(m_a)}c(m_a(s),s)&lt;\\infty].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ObeysCost}(A,c)\\iff\\mathrm{CostFunction}(c)\\land\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^2}\\,[\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(m_a)}c(m_a(s),s)&lt;\\infty].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>近似条件通过内部谓词明确量化最终稳定阶段，不对未收敛的候选调用极限值。每个阶段只按最小变化位置收费；无变化阶段贡献零。阶段规范相差一位可通过重索引实现。</p>\n<p>本次仅核查形式化的内部一致性，未重新核对原书陈述或完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cost-function","status":"resolved","id":"a404d2c25074b0b1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cost-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"e87d656c032390a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cost-function","status":"resolved","id":"a404d2c25074b0b1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$；$\\mathrm{CostFunction}$ 见 [[43-df-cost-function]]；$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是下式量化的全函数；$\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)$ 采用 [[43-df-computable-approximation]] 中可计算且逐输入最终稳定于 $A$ 的正式定义。下式为每个 $a$ 构造仅在变化阶段定义的 $m_a$；费用级数在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中取非负级数和。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"e87d656c032390a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$；$\\mathrm{CostFunction}$ 见 [[43-df-cost-function]]；$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是下式量化的全函数；$\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)$ 采用 [[43-df-computable-approximation]] 中可计算且逐输入最终稳定于 $A$ 的正式定义。下式为每个 $a$ 构造仅在变化阶段定义的 $m_a$；费用级数在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中取非负级数和。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CostFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"m_a","display":false},{"tex":"[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(m_a):=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists x\\in\\mathbb N\\;a(x,s)\\ne a(x,s+1)\\},\\qquad m_a(s):=\\min\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:a(x,s)\\ne a(x,s+1)\\}\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(m_a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ObeysCost}(A,c)\\iff\\mathrm{CostFunction}(c)\\land\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^2}\\,[\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(m_a)}c(m_a(s),s)<\\infty].","display":true}],"bytes":1860,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-obeys-cost]] — 近似服从代价"},{"id":"2802ffac8a9caa38","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$c_K$ 与 $\\mathrm{ObeysCost}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-cost]]、[[43-df-obeys-cost]]；K 平凡性见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]。"}],"outgoing":["a404d2c25074b0b1","f357216a7edb035a","e87d656c032390a9"]}